WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.940
World Masterpiece Theater

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
Homeless Child Remy

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
"About Love"

00:15.260 --> 00:23.200
I continue wishing to see you

00:23.690 --> 00:28.360
Today we'll go on a journey

00:28.450 --> 00:32.310
That's as endless as the blue sky

00:32.820 --> 00:40.990
With joy, sorrow and hope come setbacks

00:41.360 --> 00:46.040
They repeat, they repeat

00:46.280 --> 00:50.870
What should I believe?

00:51.510 --> 00:59.880
You know nothing about love, however

01:00.320 --> 01:08.900
Someday you will feel warmth inside

01:09.730 --> 01:19.860
I dream of the day when you'll speak of love

01:20.860 --> 01:28.660
Tomorrow, our journey will begin

01:29.510 --> 01:35.000
Presented by:
Takara Fansubs & Migoto

01:35.040 --> 01:39.950
Episode 26:
My Mother

01:46.310 --> 01:48.490
Remy, let's hurry, to the Grand Hotel.

01:48.500 --> 01:49.220
Yup.

01:52.780 --> 01:54.330
We've been waiting for you!

01:54.340 --> 01:55.800
You've wasted our time!

01:56.350 --> 01:57.740
Gaspard!

02:01.140 --> 02:02.190
Mattia!

02:03.690 --> 02:07.170
You'll come with me, little lady.

02:07.690 --> 02:09.110
No! No!

02:09.130 --> 02:10.760
Let Remy go!

02:10.770 --> 02:11.780
Shut up!

02:17.870 --> 02:18.930
Gaspard!

02:19.200 --> 02:20.710
Take this!

02:20.720 --> 02:21.620
You!

02:23.490 --> 02:25.120
Remy, hurry!
- Right!

02:28.960 --> 02:29.940
You!

02:30.030 --> 02:32.120
After them! Move it!

02:34.150 --> 02:38.460
Remy, I will catch you.
I'll never let you escape!

02:39.880 --> 02:42.230
Damn it, where'd they go?

02:43.520 --> 02:45.780
They can't have gone far.

02:46.060 --> 02:48.380
Find them! Find them!

03:15.480 --> 03:17.630
After them! Get them!

03:23.860 --> 03:25.640
This is our chance. Let's go!

03:25.930 --> 03:26.730
Right!

03:32.160 --> 03:33.910
This way! After them!

03:43.060 --> 03:45.140
Capi! Joli-Coeur!

03:48.590 --> 03:51.210
Great job!
- Check over there!

03:51.440 --> 03:53.090
They've got to be around here.

03:55.280 --> 03:55.840
I've found them!

03:56.210 --> 03:57.510
Over there!

03:57.870 --> 03:58.670
Come on!

04:00.800 --> 04:02.720
Stop! Stop!

04:03.510 --> 04:04.980
They're so persistent!

04:12.880 --> 04:14.520
Now you're trapped!

04:14.620 --> 04:15.880
Remy, this way!

04:22.570 --> 04:24.780
You won't get past me!

04:25.760 --> 04:28.960
Mattia, just hand Remy over to us quietly.
- Heh!

04:28.980 --> 04:30.960
No way!
- What?

04:31.310 --> 04:32.640
Remy, go!

04:32.710 --> 04:34.610
But...
- Hurry!

04:34.700 --> 04:36.370
Go to the Grand Hotel!

04:36.370 --> 04:39.170
Your mother is waiting for you there!
- Mattia... You...

04:41.630 --> 04:43.130
I told you before!

04:43.150 --> 04:44.680
I won't let you pass!

04:45.290 --> 04:46.960
Capi! Help Remy!

04:48.920 --> 04:51.810
Mattia... I...
- Go, now!

04:52.340 --> 04:53.650
Go!

04:57.030 --> 04:58.020
I won't let her escape!

04:58.840 --> 05:01.280
Catch her if you can!

05:07.410 --> 05:09.940
You... You got in the way!

05:12.770 --> 05:13.780
Mattia...

05:13.780 --> 05:15.420
Quit playing around!

05:17.130 --> 05:19.300
I've been waiting for this for so long!

05:20.700 --> 05:22.290
You brat...

05:22.820 --> 05:26.300
Mattia... You deserve this!

05:26.380 --> 05:27.910
Take that!

05:30.700 --> 05:33.170
You brat!

05:41.650 --> 05:42.820
Brat!

05:42.830 --> 05:43.950
Brat!

05:44.960 --> 05:47.050
Shouldn't you ease up on him?

05:47.060 --> 05:47.940
You're gonna kill him.

05:48.510 --> 05:51.170
I don't care if this brat dies.

05:52.250 --> 05:53.400
Mattia!

05:54.850 --> 05:57.210
Oh no... Oh no...

05:58.460 --> 06:01.210
Mattia, wake up! Mattia!

06:03.560 --> 06:04.580
Remy...

06:04.590 --> 06:06.220
Why did you come back?

06:07.020 --> 06:10.970
Because... Fortune has not abandoned me yet.

06:11.870 --> 06:14.170
You're a good little lady.

06:14.190 --> 06:17.300
L-Let Remy go!
- Shut up!

06:20.270 --> 06:21.730
Watch them!

06:22.110 --> 06:23.990
I'll go to the hotel.

06:24.000 --> 06:28.240
Her mother won't care how much money she pays for her.

06:28.280 --> 06:29.620
You're right.

06:33.830 --> 06:35.330
Mother...

06:35.900 --> 06:38.240
Sorry for making you worry.

06:38.450 --> 06:39.540
It's okay.

06:43.740 --> 06:48.410
Once miss Remy returns, your mother will get better.

06:49.870 --> 06:51.600
You're right.

07:01.420 --> 07:03.860
This is the Grand Hotel.

07:04.070 --> 07:06.130
Wow... It's awesome!

07:06.140 --> 07:07.440
Yeah, awesome!

07:08.140 --> 07:10.460
Ricardo, let's go in.

07:10.470 --> 07:12.070
Right.

07:17.460 --> 07:21.310
But we don't know if Remy and Mattia are actually in there.

07:21.340 --> 07:22.790
I'll go and ask.

07:25.680 --> 07:27.380
Hi, is Remy here?

07:27.390 --> 07:29.600
Remy, who's that?

07:29.610 --> 07:31.170
A friend of mine.

07:31.180 --> 07:33.400
She lives at Groussinou avenue.

07:33.570 --> 07:35.320
I've never heard of her.

07:35.610 --> 07:38.530
This isn't a place that you're supposed to visit.

07:38.550 --> 07:41.230
Go home! You're blocking the guests.

07:42.610 --> 07:45.150
Hah!
- Hey!

07:45.820 --> 07:47.050
What a brat!

07:47.060 --> 07:49.320
Uh oh... Run!

07:49.710 --> 07:52.150
What should we do now, Ricardo?

07:52.180 --> 07:56.970
Yeah... It won't be easy for us to get into that hotel.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.040
I'm sorry.

07:58.500 --> 08:00.910
Look... There's the boss.

08:04.410 --> 08:06.500
Welcome!

08:07.280 --> 08:09.760
What's the boss doing here?

08:10.060 --> 08:11.500
What about Remy?

08:11.690 --> 08:13.010
What happened to Remy?

08:21.180 --> 08:22.790
Mattia, are you all right?

08:22.800 --> 08:23.520
Listen...

08:23.870 --> 08:27.700
You stay here quietly, happily together.

08:33.700 --> 08:36.200
All we have to do is wait for the money.

08:36.620 --> 08:39.390
Remy...
- Mattia!

08:40.040 --> 08:41.460
Why did you come back?

08:41.890 --> 08:45.460
I couldn't go without you.

08:46.370 --> 08:48.430
This is just what Gaspard wanted.

08:50.370 --> 08:52.720
You're crazy!
- No, I'm not!

08:53.460 --> 08:56.720
We promised.
That we'd never be separated.

08:57.290 --> 08:59.180
That we'd be together forever.

09:02.290 --> 09:08.030
Soon we'll forget... about that promise we made.

09:08.040 --> 09:09.430
That's not true!

09:10.700 --> 09:13.860
Because, Mattia, I like...

09:50.870 --> 09:51.790
Capi?

09:51.920 --> 09:52.740
Is that you, Capi?

09:55.680 --> 09:57.740
Oh... Thank goodness!

09:58.400 --> 10:00.630
Capi, please go and get someone.

10:00.670 --> 10:02.740
Let someone know we're here.

10:09.130 --> 10:10.750
Capi, what's wrong?

10:11.070 --> 10:13.080
Capi? Capi?

10:13.090 --> 10:14.500
What's going on, Capi?

10:20.990 --> 10:25.730
I'm sorry, but no one will be coming to help you.

10:37.790 --> 10:39.530
Since Vitalis died,

10:39.710 --> 10:44.540
the one that's been taking care of Remy is me.

10:45.570 --> 10:48.040
And we appreciate that.

10:48.530 --> 10:50.050
Let's make this simple.

10:50.060 --> 10:54.110
If you want to see Remy again, give me 10,000 francs.

10:54.240 --> 10:57.550
I won't accept any less than that.

10:58.060 --> 11:00.020
You crook!
- You're the worst!

11:00.390 --> 11:02.560
Heh! I don't care what you think.

11:02.570 --> 11:05.890
But you'll never see Remy unless you pay it.

11:35.120 --> 11:36.850
Are you all right, Capi?

11:37.580 --> 11:38.800
That's good.

11:39.920 --> 11:41.650
Mattia, any luck?

11:42.380 --> 11:44.960
It's no use. There's no way out of here.

11:57.800 --> 11:59.370
Do you think Remy's in there?

11:59.570 --> 12:00.810
Probably.

12:01.000 --> 12:02.610
All right. Let's check it out!

12:08.450 --> 12:12.630
You should've seen that woman's face when I told to her give me 10,000 francs.

12:13.430 --> 12:16.650
Gaspard, don't forget my share.

12:16.670 --> 12:17.630
Trust me.

12:18.060 --> 12:20.640
Tomorrow we'll be rich.

12:20.980 --> 12:23.420
That's all I want.

12:30.490 --> 12:31.950
Big brother Ricardo!

12:31.960 --> 12:35.280
Just as I thought, Mattia and Remy have been locked up.

12:35.930 --> 12:37.780
Where? Where are they?

12:38.870 --> 12:40.840
I don't know.

12:43.790 --> 12:44.780
Joli-Coeur!

12:47.400 --> 12:49.700
I think he's taking us to Remy!

12:49.730 --> 12:51.540
Yeah!

12:55.010 --> 12:56.340
Joli-Coeur!

12:57.020 --> 12:58.400
Are you there?

12:58.410 --> 12:59.040
Remy?

13:00.780 --> 13:02.700
Lise? Is that you, Lise?

13:02.710 --> 13:04.210
Yes, it's me.

13:04.300 --> 13:06.150
Mattia, are you there?

13:06.160 --> 13:07.050
Ricardo!

13:07.920 --> 13:09.870
Remy and Mattia are all right.

13:11.800 --> 13:14.060
Shhh! Gaspard might hear us.

13:15.600 --> 13:18.070
We'll have you out soon.
- Ricardo!

13:18.650 --> 13:20.200
We can't do this by ourselves.

13:20.310 --> 13:22.070
Mary's at the Grand Hotel.

13:22.250 --> 13:23.240
Go and ask her for help!

13:25.000 --> 13:25.820
Got it!

13:27.180 --> 13:29.120
The Grand Hotel... The Grand Hotel...

13:29.330 --> 13:31.200
And guess what happened next...

13:31.520 --> 13:33.120
Get out of the way!

13:39.230 --> 13:40.630
Huh? What's that noise?

13:42.160 --> 13:43.840
All right! One more time!

13:47.590 --> 13:49.150
All right! Here we go!

13:53.930 --> 13:57.110
All right! We'll do it this time!
- Yes!

13:58.150 --> 14:00.000
We did it! We did it!

14:01.100 --> 14:02.730
Remy, hurry and get out!

14:02.900 --> 14:04.150
Right!

14:04.540 --> 14:05.620
Remy!

14:05.650 --> 14:08.160
Thank you! Thank you, everyone!

14:09.600 --> 14:12.160
Joli-Coeur!
- You guys!

14:13.450 --> 14:15.410
Why did you come back to Paris?

14:16.200 --> 14:19.870
Don't you know what'll happen if you disobey me?

14:19.900 --> 14:21.510
We won't let Remy go with you!

14:21.520 --> 14:23.210
That's right! We'll protect Remy!

14:23.220 --> 14:25.430
We'll protect Remy!
- We'll protect Remy!

14:25.440 --> 14:28.030
We'll protect Remy!
- We'll protect her!

14:28.250 --> 14:30.510
Heh, what can you do by yourselves?

14:30.530 --> 14:32.140
Get her!
- Right!

14:34.250 --> 14:37.730
Now listen and give the girl back.

14:38.270 --> 14:39.740
Never!

14:41.960 --> 14:45.770
Stupid dog, do you want to be hit?

14:46.590 --> 14:47.820
You brat!

14:48.560 --> 14:49.820
Don't move!

14:50.580 --> 14:52.610
You want something to happen to him?

14:52.630 --> 14:53.820
Stop!

14:54.490 --> 14:55.200
Huh?

14:55.540 --> 14:59.040
You're under arrest for kidnapping and threatening lives!

14:59.490 --> 15:01.960
You knaves! Give us Remy back now!

15:02.350 --> 15:04.540
Run!

15:04.930 --> 15:07.260
Gaspard, it's over! Give up!

15:07.280 --> 15:10.970
Damn you!

15:14.170 --> 15:15.230
Just give up!

15:16.270 --> 15:17.730
Shit!

15:26.190 --> 15:28.830
Damn you, I'll never forget this!

15:38.060 --> 15:39.540
Remy...
- Huh?

15:53.850 --> 15:54.930
Mother...

15:56.010 --> 15:57.640
My mother...

16:00.490 --> 16:01.150
Remy...

16:01.710 --> 16:03.260
Mother!

16:03.650 --> 16:04.400
Remy!

16:12.860 --> 16:14.090
Mother!

16:14.210 --> 16:16.760
I've wanted to see my mother.

16:17.010 --> 16:19.780
I always dreamt this day would come.

16:20.460 --> 16:22.370
Welcome back, Remy.

16:22.840 --> 16:27.000
I'll never... I'll never lose you again.

16:29.580 --> 16:30.770
Mother...

16:31.160 --> 16:33.190
My mother...

16:33.370 --> 16:35.810
Remy!
- Mother!

16:36.950 --> 16:39.920
Welcome back, big sister!

16:43.400 --> 16:45.810
I'm glad! I'm so glad!

17:00.450 --> 17:04.420
<i>Be happy, Remy. Goodbye...</i>

17:06.080 --> 17:07.430
Let's go everyone!

17:18.410 --> 17:21.850
It's great. It's great that Remy was able to find her mother, wasn't it?

17:22.470 --> 17:25.520
I wish I could find my mother.

17:27.340 --> 17:28.910
Lise...

17:29.000 --> 17:32.580
I'm very happy for Remy.

17:32.710 --> 17:34.730
But I'm still a bit jealous of her.

17:45.690 --> 17:48.900
What's wrong, guys?
You look so sad.

17:48.920 --> 17:51.920
Big brother Mattia, what will we do now?

17:52.830 --> 17:53.930
Mattia...

17:54.220 --> 17:59.450
If Remy was here, she'd probably say “move forward”.

17:59.590 --> 18:01.820
I like that saying.

18:01.830 --> 18:03.440
Let's move forward together.

18:04.040 --> 18:08.230
We'll survive if we work together.

18:08.830 --> 18:11.990
Move forward! Look towards tomorrow.

18:12.260 --> 18:14.530
Right!
- Move forward!

18:14.540 --> 18:16.690
Look towards tomorrow!
- Right!

18:16.710 --> 18:17.990
We're all friends.

18:18.440 --> 18:22.160
Friends! Friends! Friends!

18:30.080 --> 18:31.160
Remy!

18:33.940 --> 18:36.640
What's wrong?
- Thank you, everyone!

18:36.640 --> 18:37.910
Mrs. Milligan!

18:37.920 --> 18:41.010
You shouldn't have, Mattia.
You left without saying anything.

18:41.790 --> 18:45.520
I... I don't want to be happy without you.

18:46.570 --> 18:48.010
We'll be together.

18:48.550 --> 18:51.060
Don't worry about us anymore.

18:51.090 --> 18:53.590
That's right, we were talking about that just now.

18:53.610 --> 18:55.530
Yeah, we're moving forward.

18:55.550 --> 18:58.090
We'll survive somehow.

18:58.110 --> 19:03.110
No... I would have given up if you guys weren't there for me.

19:03.520 --> 19:05.780
You guys are my best friends, so...

19:05.930 --> 19:10.610
So I will take responsibility for you all.

19:10.890 --> 19:14.310
I will find a way to provide you all a warm home.

19:14.620 --> 19:16.800
All of you along with Remy...

19:17.680 --> 19:21.190
You are all my children. You are all my family.

19:27.520 --> 19:28.480
Family?

19:28.800 --> 19:29.650
Yes.

19:30.750 --> 19:32.320
Madam...

19:32.620 --> 19:37.520
Madam, may I call you mother?

19:41.920 --> 19:44.660
Yes... Of course.

19:45.760 --> 19:47.040
Mother...

19:48.110 --> 19:50.930
Mother... My mother!

20:16.170 --> 20:18.320
When will you be going to England?

20:18.790 --> 20:20.990
As soon as I've visited Chavanon village.

20:21.000 --> 20:22.340
Chavanon village?

20:22.360 --> 20:23.080
Yes.

20:23.660 --> 20:26.510
I want to see mother Barberin and Nana.

20:26.520 --> 20:29.470
I want to tell them everything that happened to me.

20:29.480 --> 20:31.100
I see.

20:33.780 --> 20:35.750
Remy, I...

20:36.310 --> 20:37.130
Hmm?

20:37.160 --> 20:40.260
I want to be a suitable man for you.

20:40.600 --> 20:44.920
I'll study hard and become a professional violinist.

20:44.960 --> 20:45.760
And then...

20:47.300 --> 20:49.680
And then... What?

20:49.690 --> 20:50.520
I'll...

20:52.600 --> 20:54.020
I'll come back for you, Remy.

20:55.980 --> 21:04.520
Try to love yourself more

21:05.660 --> 21:06.610
Okay.

21:05.660 --> 21:14.950
Abandoned dreams can be seen again

21:15.160 --> 21:23.840
Surely, not everyone can be so strong

21:16.340 --> 21:17.550
<i>Mr. Vitalis...</i>

21:18.790 --> 21:20.740
<i>I'll never forget what you told me:</i>

21:24.170 --> 21:27.500
<i>Move forward! Look towards tomorrow.</i>

21:24.880 --> 21:35.760
The blue sky lifts all of the world's tears...

21:36.180 --> 21:45.870
Tomorrow's courage comes

21:46.110 --> 21:55.840
From the future that gives us our fate

21:56.110 --> 22:04.560
Try to look at them more

22:05.580 --> 22:09.280
You're beautiful now that

22:09.520 --> 22:21.270
Your eyes are filled with laughter

22:21.270 --> 22:31.480
Tomorrow I promise that

22:31.870 --> 22:41.260
There will always be mistakes but

22:41.620 --> 22:50.350
Try to seek for them more

22:51.190 --> 22:55.120
Give your heart to

22:55.160 --> 23:08.130
That person who is also seeking you
